			}]
			title: "Resilience"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D54B17785EC3EC0"]
			description: [
				"The Raevyx is a rare, combat-oriented dragon species known for its nomadic behavior, aerial agility, and calculated aggression. Unlike more instinct-driven dragons, Raevyxians exhibit complex emotional awareness and inherited social behaviors, making their upbringing and handling particularly important. &4&nIn the wild, they will not actively target a person without reason.&r"
				"Before a Raevyx can be tamed, &4&nit must first be subdued in combat&r. Wild Raevyxians become vulnerable only after their health is &4&nreduced to approximately 60 HP&r, causing the dragon to enter a stunned state. Once stunned, the dragon may be fed preferred foods such as &n&4raw cod, salmon, beef, and Hearty Dragon Meal&r."
				"Feeding a Raevyx does not guarantee successful taming. Failed attempts will restore a portion of the dragon's health, immediately ending its stunned state and forcing the player to subdue it again."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/raevyx.png width:300 height:129 align:center}"
			]
			id: "65D9302038D75A53"
