		{
			dependencies: ["4D54B17785EC3EC0"]
			description: [
				"The Stegonaut is a heavily armored defensive dragon species known for its exceptional protective instincts, social imprinting behavior, and battlefield resilience. Stegonauts prioritize allied defense above direct confrontation, frequently positioning themselves between danger and bonded entities without requiring direct commands. Their immense durability and willingness to absorb incoming force made them highly valued companions for both riders and accompanying creatures. Stegonauts are particularly notable for their compatibility with allied mounts, pets, and cooperative combat behavior. &4&nIn the wild, they are notably peaceful.&r"
				"Stegonauts can be &n&4tamed through direct feeding using a single favored food item, such as raw cod, salmon, or hearty dragon meal&r. Due to the species' naturally social and imprint-driven behavior, successful taming relies less on subduing aggression and more on establishing immediate trust and recognition."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/stegonaut.png width:300 height:177 align:center}"
			]
			id: "495F0F7106CC9D01"
			rewards: [
