		{
			dependencies: ["4D54B17785EC3EC0"]
			description: [
				"The Nulljaw is a passive End-adapted dragon species known for its slow drifting behavior and unusually quiet temperament. Unlike many dragon species, Nulljaws spend the majority of their existence suspended high above the End's landscape, traveling in loose airborne groups across void-touched regions. Due to their calm nature and persistent aerial drifting, sightings of Nulljaw groups are often associated with silence, low visibility conditions, and unusually still atmospheric environments within the End. &4&nIt is always passive.&r"
				"Nulljaw can be tamed by &n&4feeding it Chorus Fruit&r, which can be found in the End Barrens. Simply hold it out to lure Nulljaws close for taming."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/nulljaw.png width:300 height:89 align:center}"
			]
			id: "3E5ABF732BC0002B"
			rewards: [
