		{
			description: [
				"Moops are curious fish with simple minds and complex evolutionary abilities, known to be found in rivers. Being about the size of Salmon, Moop are easily identifiable by their tan colours and yellow stripes. The most well-known trait of the Moop to ecologists and Dragon Researchers is the unique blend of proteins and bacteria in their bodies that halts the growth of Dragons that eat them. "
				"When a Raw Moop is fed to a baby dragon, it will cause them to permanently cease growing. This is a useful tool for keeping your dragons cute and space-efficient. "
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
