		{
			dependencies: ["4D54B17785EC3EC0"]
			description: [
				"In exploring the Ancient Cities of the old world, I've discovered scripts describing the creation of an ancient forge I have dubbed The Draconic Crucible. I've recreated it with &4&nAncient Dragonite Fragments found in the same Ancient Cities&r."
				"Being a forge, it requires a heavy amount of heat to operate. Blaze Powder has been an easily obtainable source of this, but I believe something could be &4&ncreated with Cindervane scales and coal&r."
				""
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/draconic-crucible.png width:520 height:369 align:center}"
			]
			id: "2AC31E694EFB6EB3"
			tasks: [{
				id: "27D578D28536AEAA"
				item: "saintsdragons:draconic_crucible"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -7.5d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The first part of the main progression steps are as follow:"
				"(reveal if you want to be spoiled)"
				""
				"||1. Explore ancient cities to find Ancient Dragonite Fragments"
				"2. Craft a Draconic Crucible (the new main crafting station of the mod)"
				"3. Mine the new Worldroot Ore in deep deepslate layers"
				"4. Obtain blaze powder to use as fuel for the Draconic Crucible (this is a tier 2 fuel item), or alternatively, tame a Cindervane and harvest its scales to craft Searing Coals (also tier 2 fuel item)"
				"4. Smelt the new Worldroot ores in the Draconic Crucible (require tier 2 fuels)"
				"5. Craft Worldroot tools (they're better than diamond but weaker than netherite)"
				""
				"The rest i'll let other players figure out||"
			]
			id: "536A723164A346B6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1CDA08B69C99E7FB"
				type: "custom"
			}]
			x: -7.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2AC31E694EFB6EB3"]
			description: ["There are tales of an ancient material, older than the world itself. Found deep within the earth under immense pressure, it is known as &4&nWorld Root&r. I have found the material to be real, and very, very hard, requiring at least diamond tier tools to break, and can onl"]
			id: "18C4659AC9FEDFED"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6C62FEE12BC820E5"
				item: "saintsdragons:raw_worldroot"
