			x: -9.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18C4659AC9FEDFED"]
			description: ["With smelted Worldroot, Echo Shards, and a Dragon Seal Stone I found within ancient cities, I've crated a core that, in theory, may be able to bind a dragon. I just need to find a way to add further connection to a particular species."]
			id: "6D3D534CCE38C433"
